OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers through
OL,7,Fthe evening. Cloud thickening late in
OL,8,Fthe night, with more widespread
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain developing, locally
OL,10,Fheavy over the Pennines and Dales.
OL,11,FWinds easing but remaining breezy.
OL,12,FTemperatures around average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA cloudy and damp start for
OL,15,Fmany places. Cloud slowly breaks and
OL,16,Frain turns patchy through the morning,
OL,17,Fwith many areas dry through the
OL,18,Fafternoon. Mild with winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
